{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_001_02_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:576f377fce860e295ff106c07a591e78bdc6cc57daeb5d2a32911e7083453f30",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70ca9ea5d069ad65933d4b5779a4b874aa4b93313da8d5a45dd704e829badad8",
      "text": "真是的，翔太！好啦，快点起来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca901a7a9e1b21392b98749153cb2c1ab27056a5d86d5328d98018e72c58ddbe",
      "text": "唔——……姐姐……？\n我知道了啦……呼噜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24a91b5bd54f5ebf47dc6cdfa40177c54aaa54cc34d60508785b1c42fdae1996",
      "text": "不好意思，给你们添麻烦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_c:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7679077774123ca2c87201b93c97e228397cf0c89fa53b38cafcbed55728749d",
      "text": "不，是我们这边才对，让您特意到巴士来接他，\n真是抱歉。那么，他就交给您了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_c:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:acb8220964ab776f42a36cd554dc143a8b758e21f22cf613b4c88bdf368bd3c4",
      "text": "真是的……明明跳舞最厉害，\n却是个这么让人操心的家伙。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_c:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5a5a602398fbebb49731b75d68c3d6518adfd5184e749653be8b550770bf04c",
      "text": "……呐，我一直挺好奇的。\n冬马为什么会想要当偶像呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_c:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f43c3b2fd3625444574d9d4b21f3f6ca67fcfb66e976d0d3fb58a1a1760d969",
      "text": "既然都参加比赛了，\n是对艺人或偶像怀有憧憬之类的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_c:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbbf3df9235baee572cb32137e075ef3955ec90814c554b0e435d9873f670bf8",
      "text": "不。我对偶像什么的，老实说毫无兴趣。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_c:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae97e110c0fc4bc85dfdc56c83dee9e0a8039eb200fc739d6e90639b0634c712",
      "text": "去参加比赛是因为跟朋友打赌，\n半开玩笑去报的名。然而……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_c:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7377adede0f4b923d21fea9cbb6d5bdcefa29914dd8f99d7113fe11726a2aa8b",
      "text": "拿到优胜的时候，感觉爽极了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_c:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9a7153b7294ff01ac5231d03de93905e573cc52e4a0eba9c4f4f5a4dd018f7c",
      "text": "在那之前，将来想成为什么、有什么目标，\n我全都没有……但那一次，让我热血沸腾了起来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_c:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:851c3c1e5faeda5378a5d0024d29fec89c7fcfec93cb7750a330c44ef96b967d",
      "text": "我便想着，要在偶像这个世界里战斗，\n成为第一名。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_c:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87246f2789a8c0e408b9e6358fdc1f4233f60f46b40c85a39a9dd10fe2f39cbc",
      "text": "那你呢？\n你又是为什么当偶像的？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_c:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:550dbc697826cfe66f9258731f69b55167a9b5c0ce4acd4cd5e0ad8b52ccc66d",
      "text": "我是……",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
